From 7e7813e50b9d42b77fe5a0e6d95cfe1bb38d13dd Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: zh-CN <noreply@local>
Date: Wed, 23 Sep 2026 10:53:59 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] zh-CN: UTF-8 safe forecast marquee and Simplified Chinese
 catalogue

- panel.lua: walk the marquee by UTF-8 character boundaries instead of bytes
  (byte-wise prefixes split multi-byte glyphs and triggered 'Invalid caret advance')
- model.lua/panel.lua: allow non-ASCII display text (still reject control characters
  and semicolons)
- panel.lua: allow up to 2 em per caret step so ~1em CJK glyphs pass the sanity check
- catalogue.lua/heavy_data.lua: Simplified Chinese text, terminology taken from the
  game's official zh-Hans resources
---
