 .../KnowYourConstellation/src/heavy_data.lua  |  2 +-
 .../KnowYourConstellation/src/model.lua       | 22 +++---
 .../KnowYourConstellation/src/panel.lua       | 52 ++++++++++----
 4 files changed, 87 insertions(+), 56 deletions(-)

